    "#AgentMentor Analytics Platform — Capstone (Tasks A, B, C, D4, D6)\n",
    "**Dataset:** DIU AgentMentor student data (SGPA Trends, Semester Results, Payment Status, Counselling Log)\n",
    "**LLM:** Groq (llama-3.3-70b-versatile) — schema-aware NL→code→insight pipeline\n",
    "**Vector store:** offline TF-IDF cosine-similarity index (no external model download required)\n",
    "\n",
    "> Set your Groq key via environment variable or a secrets manager — **never hardcode it**. The key found hardcoded in the original notebook should be rotated in the Groq console.\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Scope note:** The formal capstone rubric expects a public dataset with ≥5,000 rows / ≥8 columns (D1–D6 list). This notebook instead uses the AgentMentor student dataset (~62 students, 4 linked tables) at the user's request — swap `EXCEL_PATH` and the schema dicts in Phase A if you need to satisfy that row-count requirement with one of the listed datasets instead.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "## Table of contents\n",
    "- Phase 0: Setup\n",
    "- Task A: Data Layer & Backend (A1–A4)\n",
    "- Vector Store (feeds Task B & D1-style search)\n",
    "- Task B: LLM Integration & NL Query Engine (B1–B5)\n",
    "- Task C: Visualization & Dashboard (C1–C4)\n",
    "- Task D4: Multi-turn ReAct Agent\n",
    "- Task D6: Data Storytelling Mode\n"
   ]
  },
