    "## 📊 Task A — Data Layer & Backend\n",
    "\n",
    "### A1 — Ingestion, schema inspection & the \"add all\" merge\n",
    "\n",
    "The 4 sheets have different grains:\n",
    "- `SGPA Trends` — 1 row per student (identity + CGPA + per-semester SGPA)\n",
    "- `Semester Results` — many rows per student (1 per course)\n",
    "- `Payment Status` — 1 row per student\n",
    "- `Counselling Log` — many rows per student (1 per session)\n",
    "\n",
    "To \"add all\" into one queryable table we **aggregate the many-row sheets down to student grain first**, then left-merge everything onto `SGPA Trends` on `Student ID`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "e3284eb1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
